<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Native-parity Settings / Theme / Language strings (NP Phase 2, GAP-SET / GAP-THM / GAP-LANG cluster).

  Net-new + reused-legacy-key parity strings for the Settings hub, Theme picker, Language picker
  and the shared Feedback / ReadingMode / CBZ-conversion dialogs. Kept in a separate file (per NP
  convention) from the shared :ui strings.xml so the parity additions are reviewable as a unit.

  Reused legacy keys (en values verbatim from the old app's values/strings.xml; the matching
  values-ar/strings_np_settings_theme_lang.xml carries the trusted Arabic verbatim from the old
  app's values-ar/strings.xml):
    - we_d_love_to_hear_from_you, connect_with_us_in_social_media,
      you_ll_receive_a_prompt_response  (FeedbackDialog social section, GAP-SET-12)
    - but_revert, but_apply  (ReadingModeDialog footer, GAP-SET-14)
    - converting_to_cbz, conversion_complete_, conversion_stopped, conversion_failed,
      please_don_t_close_the_app_until_conversion_is_complete, completed, remaining, current,
      chapter, stop_conversion, close, closure_reason_done  (CbzConversionDialog, GAP-SET-16)
    - feedbacks_and_complaints  (Settings nav-row label, GAP-SET-06)
  New en-only keys (toggle descriptions / CBZ section copy lifted from inline literals,
  GAP-SET-21): setting_downloaded_only_desc, setting_incognito_desc, follow_system_theme_desc,
  theme_dark_desc, theme_light_desc, testing_mode, use_kira_compressor,
  use_kira_compressor_desc, auto_convert_on_download, auto_convert_on_download_desc,
  compress_existing_downloads, compress_existing_downloads_desc, start_conversion, converting,
  settings_header_icon, cache_cleared, conversion_complete, feedback_submitted,
  feedback_submit_failed.
-->
